  "schema": "qb-kan114-root-build-allow/1",
  "rule": "root-build-patternB-v1",
  "decision": "KAN-114 10720 item 1-2 (U2 only: narrowly specified pattern-B root build). PROPOSED for senior review; not applied in any run.",
  "source": "public repository files at each pinned base (package.json bytes + git tree id), read by the controller; no task, test or answer material",
  "install": "UNCHANGED deps-root-scripts-v1 transform (sandbox/research/deps-root-scripts.sh): root `prepare` removed from the disposable install copy only; npm ci via the registry-only DEPS proxy, no credentials; dependency lifecycle scripts still run, contained as before",
  "offline_build": "after install, in the agent image with --network none, no credentials, no grader material, read-only node_modules: exactly `npm run build` (npm runs build -> npm-run-all --parallel build:* -> postbuild; every one of those script strings is sha256-pinned per base; no prebuild exists). Never run: check-export-map, husky, npm-merge-driver-install, lint, test. The build must leave no tracked change and no untracked non-ignored file (git status --porcelain empty), else the task fails setup qualification (recorded).",
  "excluded": "lockfile-v1 tasks (2757, 3062, 2927, 3010, 2896) and briefing-leak-v1 tasks (3345, 3763, 4182) are NOT listed: out of U2 scope (10720)",
